+    // the values differ. Refresh the coarse operator by recomputing the Galerkin triple
+    // product coarse = R * A_new * P on the device, reusing the existing prolong/restrict.
+    // This is the solver-cache fast path (Multigrid::update_matrix_value) -- it avoids
+    // re-running the (host) PMIS coarsening every solve.
